      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "遲遲都不下雨呢～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9072907290FD4E0D4E0B96E85462FF5E00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "滴答滴答，淅淅瀝瀝……\n好棒的下雨天！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6EF47B546EF47B54FF0C6DC56DC5701D701D20262026000A597D68D276844E0B96E85929FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我說呀，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在寶可夢對戰時\n有在意過天氣嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAA5440FF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B357285BF653EF59225C0D62306642000A67095728610F904E59296C2355CEFF1F00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的寶可夢們\n在下雨天可是強得很呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845BF653EF59225011000A57284E0B96E8592953EF662F5F375F975F885462FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是下了雨，我們就來一決勝負吧。\n我會讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳見識我的真本事！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4E0B4E8696E8FF0C621150115C314F864E006C7A52DD8CA054273002000A621167038B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B3898B8B5862117684771F672C4E8BFF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在雨停之前，我們來一決勝負吧。\n我會讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳見識我的真本事！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572896E8505C4E4B524DFF0C621150114F864E006C7A52DD8CA054273002000A621167038B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B3898B8B5862117684771F672C4E8BFF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雨天不打烊！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能對戰時，就來告訴我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96E859294E0D625370CAFF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD5C0D62306642FF0C5C314F86544A8A3462115427FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳見識到寶可夢們的亮點的，\n所以要是下了雨，我們就來一決勝負吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n……咦？<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳該不會是打算等到下雨吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167038B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B3898B8B5852305BF653EF5922501176844EAE9EDE7684FF0C000A62404EE58981662F4E0B4E8696E8FF0C621150115C314F864E006C7A52DD8CA05427FF0100100001BE01000A2026202654A6FF1F00100003110000FF01014F6059B38A724E0D6703662F62537B977B4952304E0B96E85427FF1F00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要等！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189817B49FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒打算等<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9262537B977B4900100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們趁著下雨時，\n來一決勝負吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我會讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳見識到\n寶可夢們的亮點的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150118D8184574E0B96E86642FF0C000A4F864E006C7A52DD8CA05427300200100001BE01000A621167038B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B3898B8B585230000A5BF653EF5922501176844EAE9EDE7684300200100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請讓我見識一番！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB8B936211898B8B584E00756AFF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "下雨天會淋濕耶……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0B96E8592967036DCB6FD580362026202600100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這樣啊，\n當然是不等呴……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196A23554AFF0C000A75767136662F4E0D7B4954742026202600100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗄！那雨就要停掉了耶！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55C4FF0190A396E85C318981505C63894E868036FF01FF1F00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦！<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳那麼想和我一決勝負！？\n那我們就等一等雨吧……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E6FF0100100003110000FF01014F6059B390A39EBC60F3548C62114E006C7A52DD8CA0FF01FF1F000A90A3621150115C317B494E007B4996E854272026202600100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "下了！下雨了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0B4E86FF014E0B96E84E86FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的寶可夢的招式在下雨天會是最強的！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看看水屬性和雨天組合起來會如何吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845BF653EF5922768462DB5F0F57284E0B96E859296703662F67005F377684FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3770B770B6C345C6C6027548C96E859297D4454088D774F86670359824F555427FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把水屬性和雨天組合起來\n也沒轍啊……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A6C345C6C6027548C96E859297D4454088D774F86000A4E5F6C928F4D554A2026202600100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的每隻寶可夢都會用\n水屬性的招式對吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176846BCF96BB5BF653EF592290FD67037528000A6C345C6C6027768462DB5F0F5C0D5427FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水屬性的招式遇上雨天就會變強！\n所以我認為我會贏的說……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C345C6C6027768462DB5F0F90474E0A96E859295C3167038B8A5F37FF01000A62404EE562118A8D70BA621167038D0F76848AAA2026202600100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉，不過話說回來，<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5509FF0C4E0D904E8A718AAA56DE4F86FF0C00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火屬性的招式就會弱掉了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B5C6C6027768462DB5F0F5C3167035F3163894E86300200100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟會被雨給淋濕，\n所以那也是理所當然的就是了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF670388AB96E87D666DCB6FD5FF0C000A62404EE590A34E5F662F740662407576713676845C31662F4E86FF0100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要一下雨，\n水屬性的招式威力就會增加喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
